LiquidityChunkIntroTest
├── when tick spacing is zero
│   └── it should normalize spacing to one
├── when tick spacing is greater than two hundred
│   └── it should normalize spacing to two hundred
├── when the lower tick is below the minimum tick
│   └── it should revert with TickOutOfBounds
├── when the upper tick is above the maximum tick
│   └── it should revert with TickOutOfBounds
├── when the lower tick is not aligned
│   └── it should revert with TickNotAligned
├── when the upper tick is not aligned
│   └── it should revert with TickNotAligned
├── when the lower tick equals the upper tick
│   └── it should revert with TicksMisordered
├── when the lower tick is greater than the upper tick
│   └── it should revert with TicksMisordered
├── when liquidity is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroLiquidity
└── when both ticks are in bounds and aligned and liquidity is positive
    └── it should return the typed liquidity chunk
